      "text": "Hangauer Lab Principal Investigator Matt Hangauer, Ph.D. Assistant Professor Department of Dermatology UC San Diego mhangauer@ucsd.edu Publications: PubMed Hangauer L ab Website Contact the Lab Mailing Address Department of Dermatology, Department of Medicine University of California San Diego 9500 Gilman Drive, Mail Code 0869 La Jolla, CA 92093-0869 Laboratory Address Altman Clinical and Translational Research Institute (ACTRI) 9452 Medical Center Drive L1W419 / L1W420 La Jolla, CA 92037 Phone Office: 858-82 2-7954 Admin Assistant: 858-82 2-6118 (Kari Balcer) Hangauer Lab Focus The Hangauer lab focuses on understanding the fundamental mechanisms of cell survival of cytotoxic stress. We seek to discover how cells survive prolonged exposure to various physiological forms of cytotoxic stress, the adaptations which occur as a result of this, and how this affects human health and disease. We also seek to understand why certain cells are sensitized to nonapoptotic death pathways including ferroptosis and cuproptosis.",
